<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-6920] Web console: Prepare Web Console package with simple deploy.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6920</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Package Web Console backend into an executable that can be run even on devices without Node.js installed.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Let Web Console backend will be used to serve static files (compiled Web Console frontend)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Let Web Console backend download and run as child process mongoDB. if mongoDB is not installed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
                <environment></environment>
