                                                                                                                                                            <comments>
                            <comment id="16253547" author="anovikov" created="Wed, 15 Nov 2017 14:46:29 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Implemented direct install build.&lt;br/&gt;
How to use:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;In &amp;lt;modules/web-console/backend&amp;gt; run in terminal following command: &lt;tt&gt;npm run build&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;copy &amp;lt;modules/web-console/backend/build/ignite-web-console*&amp;gt; to &amp;lt;direct-install-dist&amp;gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;build Web Console agent. Copy agent archive &amp;lt;modules/web-console/web-agent/target/ignite-web-agent-*.zip&amp;gt; to &amp;lt;direct-install-dist/libs/agent_dists&amp;gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;build Web Console frontend. Copy static files &amp;lt;modules/web-console/frontend/build/*&amp;gt; to &amp;lt;direct-install-dist/libs/frontend&amp;gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Create folder &amp;lt;direct-install-dist/user_data&amp;gt;, &amp;lt;direct-install-dist/libs/mongodb/mongodb-download&amp;gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=kuaw26&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;kuaw26&quot;&gt;kuaw26&lt;/a&gt;, please review, my changes.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16253588" author="kuaw26" created="Wed, 15 Nov 2017 15:14:17 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=anovikov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;anovikov&quot;&gt;anovikov&lt;/a&gt; Looks good for me.&lt;br/&gt;
One minor note - add new section about this package to DEVNOTES.txt and ask &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=pkonstantinov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;pkonstantinov&quot;&gt;pkonstantinov&lt;/a&gt; to test Web Console packaged by this instruction.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16254713" author="anovikov" created="Thu, 16 Nov 2017 03:54:44 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=kuaw26&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;kuaw26&quot;&gt;kuaw26&lt;/a&gt;, Instructions will be added to DEVNOTES.txt  in &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6927&quot; title=&quot;Web Console: Create build with maven for Web Console direct-install.&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-6927&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-6927&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=pkonstantinov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;pkonstantinov&quot;&gt;pkonstantinov&lt;/a&gt;, please test.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16256409" author="pkonstantinov" created="Fri, 17 Nov 2017 03:18:51 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Successfully tested in branch&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16331668" author="anovikov" created="Fri, 19 Jan 2018 03:04:22 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Merged to master.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
